      "filename": "6th ANNUAL WOMEN’S HOUSING MARCH (7998506820).jpg",
      "title": "File:6th ANNUAL WOMEN’S HOUSING MARCH (7998506820).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7e/6th_ANNUAL_WOMEN%E2%80%99S_HOUSING_MARCH_%287998506820%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:6th_ANNUAL_WOMEN%E2%80%99S_HOUSING_MARCH_(7998506820).jpg",
      "width": 2100,
